%% TimeBar — venue-published via kline WS (OnBarStart on new open-time + OnBarComplete on close)
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Binance kline WS
    participant KS as KlineVenueBarSource
    participant D as StrategyDispatch
    participant Q as session MarketDataQueue
    participant ST as Strategy (IInt64BarStrategy)

    K->>KS: kline (new open-time, not closed)
    Note over KS: open-time changed → bar opened
    KS->>D: DispatchBar(instrument, TimeBar-spec, formingBar, isStart:true)
    D->>Q: enqueue ()=>OnBarStart(bar, sub)
    Q->>ST: OnBarStart(bar, sub)
    K->>KS: kline updates (same open-time)
    Note over KS: ignored (not closed, no new open)
    K->>KS: kline (IsClosed=true)
    KS->>KS: add to Recent
    KS->>D: DispatchBar(instrument, TimeBar-spec, closedBar, isStart:false)
    D->>Q: enqueue ()=>OnBarComplete(bar, sub)
    Q->>ST: OnBarComplete(bar, sub) → submit order
